      "description": "Signature: a day column with tracked day name, serif numeral, amber ring for today.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-strip\"><button class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-dname\">Lun</span><span class=\"ds-dnum\">5</span></button><button class=\"ds-day is-today\"><span class=\"ds-dname\">Mar</span><span class=\"ds-dnum\">6</span><span class=\"ds-pill-live\">Vivo 19 hs</span></button><button class=\"ds-day\"><span class=\"ds-dname\">Mié</span><span class=\"ds-dnum\">7</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,108px);background:#fff;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(26 58 76 / .06),0 8px 24px rgb(26 58 76 / .07);padding:12px 0}.ds-day{appearance:none;border:0;border-left:1px solid #EBDCD2;background:transparent;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:10px 8px 12px;min-height:116px}.ds-day:hover{background:#F3E4DA}.ds-day:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ED9615;outline-offset:2px}.ds-dname{font:700 12px/1 Karla,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#3D6B85}.ds-dnum{font:600 26px/1 'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;color:#1A3A4C;width:40px;height:40px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;margin-left:-6px}.ds-day.is-today .ds-dnum{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px #ED9615}.ds-day.is-today .ds-dname{color:#A8401F}.ds-pill-live{font:700 12px/1.25 Karla,sans-serif;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:#C9502A;color:#fff}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Continuar Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card-continue",
      "description": "Night card under the strip: lesson, cycle, sky progress, one terracotta action.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-continue\"><h3>#3 · Yo vs Otro</h3><p class=\"ds-cyc\">Hacia dónde va la Humanidad</p><div class=\"ds-bar\"><i style=\"width:50%\"></i></div><p class=\"ds-meta\">2 de 4 encuentros vistos</p><button class=\"ds-go\">Continuar</button></article>",
      "css": ".ds-continue{background:#1A3A4C;color:#DDEEF1;border-radius:18px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:420px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(26 58 76 / .06),0 8px 24px rgb(26 58 76 / .07)}.ds-continue h3{margin:0;font:600 2rem/1.1 'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;color:#fff}.ds-cyc{margin:-6px 0 0;font:italic 500 1.15rem/1.3 'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;color:#F2C58A}.ds-bar{height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgb(255 255 255 / .16);overflow:hidden}.ds-bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:#7CC3E8;border-radius:inherit}.ds-meta{margin:0;font:400 14px/1.4 Karla,sans-serif}.ds-go{align-self:flex-start;appearance:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;min-height:48px;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:999px;font:700 16px/1 Karla,sans-serif;background:#C9502A;color:#fff}.ds-go:hover{background:#A8401F}.ds-go:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ED9615;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Zoom ID Block",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "zoom-id",
      "description": "Meeting ID and passcode at 18px tabular with a 44px copy button.",
      "html": "<dl class=\"ds-zoom\"><dt>ID de reunión</dt><dd>123 4567 8910</dd><button class=\"ds-copy\">Copiar</button><dt>Código</dt><dd>ejemplo</dd><button class=\"ds-copy\">Copiar</button></dl>",
      "css": ".ds-zoom{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:6px 14px;align-items:center;background:#FBF6F2;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin:0;color:#1A3A4C}.ds-zoom dt{font:400 14px/1.3 Karla,sans-serif;color:#3D6B85}.ds-zoom dd{margin:0;font:700 18px/1.2 Karla,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.02em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-copy{appearance:none;border:0;background:transparent;color:#A8401F;font:700 14px/1 Karla,sans-serif;min-height:44px;padding:0 6px;cursor:pointer}.ds-copy:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-copy:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ED9615;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lesson Row",
      "kind": "custom",
