      "description": "Seen / next / unseen lesson ticks with a Caveat aside on the next lesson.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-lessons\"><li class=\"ds-lesson is-done\"><span class=\"ds-tick\">✓</span>#2 · Apego vs Individuación</li><li class=\"ds-lesson is-next\"><span class=\"ds-tick\">▶</span>#3 · Yo vs Otro<span class=\"ds-aside\">Seguí acá</span></li><li class=\"ds-lesson\"><span class=\"ds-tick\"></span>#4 · Potencia vs Dominación</li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-lessons{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:8px;background:#fff;border-radius:18px;max-width:440px}.ds-lesson{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:48px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:12px;font:500 16px/1.3 Karla,sans-serif;color:#1A3A4C}.ds-lesson:hover{background:#FBF6F2}.ds-tick{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px #EBDCD2;font-size:12px;color:transparent;flex:none}.ds-lesson.is-done{color:#3D6B85}.ds-lesson.is-done .ds-tick{background:#2E7FAE;box-shadow:none;color:#fff}.ds-lesson.is-next .ds-tick{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px #C9502A;color:#C9502A}.ds-aside{margin-left:auto;font:600 1.25rem/1 Caveat,'Segoe Script',cursive;color:#A8401F}"
